Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||08-10-2001||02:37 PM||||I don't know of any tricks. I don't know whats in the way of preventing you from getting to your switch or relay.I have  mine mounted on the left front frame rail I guess you would call it. And it seems pretty easy to get too for me.Maybe someone else here might know something that I'm not aware of.||||reg||1
Z||000002||AkursedX||08-10-2001||03:43 PM||||Just a word of advice, when you get it out and put the new one.  Be VERY careful to not crossthread it in there.  You will crack the housing for the switch and you will need a new lower intake.  It happened to me and it wasn't any fun.  <P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
