Z||000006||ka4nkf||08-10-2001||10:19 PM||||Take two flat blade screwdrivers and place on each side of the connector, Press both sides in while another person pulls the wire off. also do not put any teflon tape on the new one. the threads need to go to ground.||||reg||1
